              "type": "paragraph",
              "text": "Oma Skat is a traditional trick-taking card game using 32-card German or French Skat pack for 2 players. It is a two-player Skat-family game also called Grandmothers Skat."
            },
            {
              "type": "paragraph",
              "text": "Oma Skat is treated as a distinct traditional card game because the source identifies its own player count, pack, rank order, and trick-play objective rather than only listing it as a synonym."
            }
          ]
        },
